<title>GERMANY: Hypo-Bank sees higher pre-provisions profit.</title>
<headline>Hypo-Bank sees higher pre-provisions profit.</headline>
<dateline>MUNICH, Germany 1996-11-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>German commercial bank Bayerische Hypotheken- und Wechsel Bank expects group operating profit before provisions to grow by at least 10 percent in 1996, chief financial officer Werner Muenstermann said on Thursday.</p>
<p>The bank earlier said nine-month group operating profit after provisions climbed 9.9 percent to 808 million marks.</p>
<p>--Frankfurt Newsroom +49 69 756525</p>
